From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:28:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2421/3799] soh: rename func_80ADE28C -> EnPoh_SetupDamage

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: plays the damaged animation, aims the knockback away from the attacker and applies the red color filter
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Poh/z_en_poh.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Poh/z_en_poh.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Poh/z_en_poh.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Poh/z_en_poh.c
index d9363a27f..ae56550e0 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Poh/z_en_poh.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Poh/z_en_poh.c
@@ -293,7 +293,8 @@ void EnPoh_SetupAttack(EnPoh* this) {
     this->actionFunc = EnPoh_Attack;
 }
 
-void func_80ADE28C(EnPoh* this) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80ADE28C: plays the damaged animation, aims the knockback away from the attacker and applies the red color filter
+void EnPoh_SetupDamage(EnPoh* this) {
     if (this->infoIdx == EN_POH_INFO_NORMAL) {
         Animation_MorphToPlayOnce(&this->skelAnime, &gPoeDamagedAnim, -6.0f);
     } else {
@@ -878,7 +879,7 @@ void func_80AE032C(EnPoh* this, PlayState* play) {
             } else {
                 Audio_PlayActorSound2(&this->actor, NA_SE_EN_PO_DAMAGE);
             }
-            func_80ADE28C(this);
+            EnPoh_SetupDamage(this);  // was func_80ADE28C [LLM:HIGH]
         }
     }
 }
